    "WORD": "WALK",
    "GLOSS": "To advance on foot; metaphorically, to conduct one's life, behave, or follow a specific course of action.",
    "CARD_TYPE": "VERB",
    "RARITY_TEXT": "COMMON",
    "RARITY_ICON": "COMMON",
    "ART_PROMPT": "A pair of worn leather sandals resting on a dusty dirt path that winds through a grassy valley toward a distant, glowing horizon. Golden hour lighting, realistic style.",
